      "kind": "cross_object_type_confusion",
      "detail": "the final step /wf/shared/transfer/confirm EXECUTED SORD-0001 \u2014 an object of a DIFFERENT type than this flow produces (prefix SORD vs TRF) \u2014 oracle line 'SORD-0001 standing-order 800010 EXECUTED' \u2014 object type/context is not validated server-side",
      "request_id": "req-d17a9d36"
     }
    ],
    "identity": "primary scan session",
    "state_before": "SORD-0001 standing-order 800010 ACTIVE",
    "state_after": "SORD-0001 standing-order 800010 EXECUTED",
    "impact": {
     "grade": "proven",
     "statement": "Object boundary not enforced: a workflow step EXECUTED an object produced by a different flow/context (state-oracle proof) \u2014 type/context confusion lets one process consume another's objects.",
